<title>USA: Ticketmaster Q1 shr profit $0.07 vs loss.</title>
<headline>Ticketmaster Q1 shr profit $0.07 vs loss.</headline>
<text>
<p>LOS ANGELES, June 10 (Reuter)</p>
<p>		    April 30 1997	   April 30 1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.07     loss	 $0.13</p>
<p> Net profit		 1,881     loss	 1,979</p>
<p> Revs			77,003		   46,741</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  25,483		   15,310</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: EBITDA for the three months ended April 30, 1997 was $11.1 million vs $1.8 million in the year ago period. Ticketmaster sold 17.2 million tickets in the first quarter of fiscal 1998 vs 15.3 million a year ago.</p>
<p>Ticketmaster Group Inc.</p>
